      "ref": "[D172]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that strangers can message or voice chat with your child in Minecraft.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Online multiplayer games allow kids to chat with friends *and* strangers. And while most of these players may be harmless, some have far more dangerous intentions."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D172]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "The app pushes in-app purchases and virtual currency that can be targeted by scammers for unauthorized spending.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Gaming platforms have created their own economies using virtual currencies like V-Bucks (Fortnite), Robux (Roblox), and Minecoins (Minecraft). While these might seem like play money to kids, they have actual cash value and attract sophisticated criminals."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D172]",
      "area": "data",
      "claim": "The app collects personal information, payment details, and usage data that can be shared or sold, and parents can delete this data.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Modern gaming accounts often collect valuable personal information, saved payment methods, and digital items worth real money."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D172]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the age gate for Minecraft does not reliably prevent younger children from accessing the game.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Video games have long been popular with teenagers, but gaming has become an increasingly dominant part of childhood, with younger kids now gaming more than ever."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D172]",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports seeing scams, phishing links, and predatory behavior in Minecraft's multiplayer environment.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Predators build trust by connecting with kids through games, and then move kids to less moderated apps. This tactic, known as grooming, is designed to isolate young users from trusted adults."
    },
